{"4523820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Broken Dagger", "steam_appid": 4523820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broken Dagger</strong> is a dark fantasy RPG where your choices shape the world around you. Explore a dangerous land filled with secrets, forgotten ruins, and moral dilemmas—where every decision carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired heavily by old Bethesda RPGs, the game embraces player freedom, non-linear design, and multiple ways to approach every challenge. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meaningful Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every quest can be solved in different ways—through stealth, combat, deception, or negotiation. Your actions have consequences that affect the world and its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-Linear Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into villages, fields, and ancient dungeons at your own pace. Discover hidden locations, secrets, and unexpected encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic RPG Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by  old Bethesda RPGs, <i>Broken Dagger</i> focuses on freedom, experimentation, and player-driven storytelling rather than hand-holding.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broken Dagger</strong> is a dark fantasy RPG where your choices shape the world around you. Explore a dangerous land filled with secrets, forgotten ruins, and moral dilemmas—where every decision carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired heavily by old Bethesda RPGs, the game embraces player freedom, non-linear design, and multiple ways to approach every challenge. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meaningful Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every quest can be solved in different ways—through stealth, combat, deception, or negotiation. Your actions have consequences that affect the world and its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-Linear Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into villages, fields, and ancient dungeons at your own pace. Discover hidden locations, secrets, and unexpected encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic RPG Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by  old Bethesda RPGs, <i>Broken Dagger</i> focuses on freedom, experimentation, and player-driven storytelling rather than hand-holding.</p>", "short_description": "Broken Dagger is a dark fantasy RPG where your decisions truly matter. Solve quests in multiple ways, explore a living world, and forge your own path. Heavily inspired by old Bethesda RPGs, it delivers a classic RPG experience with modern design.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523820/0e70a0f27790618b17242101bb68514fdc3fa030/header.jpg?t=1786933142", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523820/e600c12235279781e2aaae49d8aeeae6d5036bf2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786933142", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4523820/e600c12235279781e2aaae49d8aeeae6d5036bf2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786933142", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2060 RTC<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Electro Soul Games"], "publishers": ["Electro Soul Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windo